  _descriptionText: 'Playful painting game for children with childish characters
    and multiple game modes to choose from.


    - Pick a childish character, paint
    it however you like and place it alongside others to make an empty ambient painting
    come to life.'
  _developmentHighlights:
  - Name: 
    Text: 'Complex UI functionality: Image gallery, favourites feature, nested scroll
      views, etc.'
  - Name: 
    Text: Post-Processing effects on painted images and rendering into local files
      for the gallery
  - Name: 
    Text: Editor tool for quick implementation of new paintable image templates
  - Name: 
    Text: Editor tool for quick implementation of exported in-game user-painted images
      inside the Ideas menu as examples
